e whose spider-man movies laid the  foundation for the modern superhero film  remains a fan favorite director in the  comic book world and will likely bring  some prestige to benedict cumberbatch's  second solo outing as steven strange  they'll be working from a script by  michael waldron the head writer of  upcoming disney plus series loki  a couple of new mcu characters will make  their debuts in the movie with some  sources suggesting that the story will  introduce the iconic marvel characters  clea and brother voodoo but you can  expect plenty of familiar faces to  appear too  elizabeth olsen scarlet witch is going  to feature prominently in the movie  while chuatel  edge of four benedick wong and rachel  mcadams are also expected to return  the madness begins on march 25th 2022  news that chris hemsworth and taiko  waititi were teaming up for another thor  movie broke days before comic con 2019  but the biggest announcement came at the  event itself that  natalie portman is returning to the  franchise the oscar winner portrayed  thor's earthbound love interest jane  foster in 2011's thor  in 2013's thor the dark world but was  absent for 2017's thor ragnarok with an  explanation  briefly given that the pair had broken  up she didn't dump me you know  i dumped her mutual dumping after that  portman appeared to be done with marvel  but her character in the marvel comics  has developed significantly since her  last film appearance  most notably in a 2014 story foster was  deemed worthy to wield thor's hammer  and adopted the title goddess of thunder  we don't know how this will all play out  on screen  but why tt clearly has big plans for  both portman and jane foster  aside from that the director has been  tight-lipped on plot details  but he at least dropped a few  tantalizing teases during an april 2020  watch party for thor ragnarok why tt  revealed that he intends to introduce  star sharks to the mcu for example  and also left the door open for a  possible lo